    "detailed_description": "<strong>Beastbound </strong>is a Roguelike / Monster Tamer fusion that takes inspirations from card based dungeon-crawlers, and fan-made challenges of other monster tamer games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/59ea634b6ef2ad131de5f51a45707c16.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br> Within each run you will be offered different <strong>Beasts</strong>, different <strong>items</strong> and <strong>encounter</strong> different events that will provide you with a <strong>unique experience</strong> each time. Try different combinations, expand your team and do the best of your limited resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.poster.avif?t=1732754804\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.webm?t=1732754804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.mp4?t=1732754804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/6f2c58b465e47627d0d545e03bd67389.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br><strong>Your Beasts retain their health between each battle!</strong> Tread carefully and take care of your team, each decision you make can affect the fate of your Beasts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/77abf60c66cbf8407f6c3674e9ff58f9.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br>Choose amongst the ranks of items and artifacts designed to complement various play-styles and shift your gameplay experience fundamentally.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/57b0d9ce857a8301251731e1279230fc.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br>Face <strong>bosses </strong>that adapt, shift and take different forms depending on <strong>your decisions</strong> in battle and on the overworld map, or on the luck of the run!<br><br><strong>Join Out Discord To Learn About Updates</strong><br><br><strong><i>We are always adding new content, trying experimental optional features and polishing the ame, join our discord to be notified of updates the moment they drop!</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Beastbound </strong>is a Roguelike / Monster Tamer fusion that takes inspirations from card based dungeon-crawlers, and fan-made challenges of other monster tamer games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/59ea634b6ef2ad131de5f51a45707c16.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br> Within each run you will be offered different <strong>Beasts</strong>, different <strong>items</strong> and <strong>encounter</strong> different events that will provide you with a <strong>unique experience</strong> each time. Try different combinations, expand your team and do the best of your limited resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.poster.avif?t=1732754804\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.webm?t=1732754804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/b972d56b54b970f62e1ed8073f27417c.mp4?t=1732754804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/6f2c58b465e47627d0d545e03bd67389.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=63 /></span><br><br><strong>Your Beasts retain their health between each battle!</strong> Tread carefully and take care of your team, each decision you make can affect the fate of your Beasts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197940/extras/77abf60c66cbf8407f6c3674e9ff58f9.webp?t=1732754804\" width=600 height=